{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1555034-i-have-a-question-about-epiphs","id":1555034,"title":"I have a question about Epiphs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-11-03T13:02:37-08:00","id":1555034,"title":"I have a question about Epiphs","content":"The first edition book of the Wyrm starts describing a list of wyrm reflections of Epiphs but I don't know where the normal Epiphs are described in detail?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 11-06-2025, 11:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-04T17:03:54-08:00","id":1555082,"title":"","content":"Epiphs are penumbral domains. They are domains of thought, usually embodying abstract concepts. These are platonic abstracts. The sourcebooks give examples like the number four, squares, or the smell of cinnamon. Garou generally find them bizarre, but some Stargazers like to use them as a focus for meditation.<br /> <br /> Epiphs are usually mentioned in the section on the Penumbra and other domains like Glens, Hellholes, Blights, Webs, and Trods. This information in first edition sourcebooks tend to be spread all over the place as the early stages of the game was still generating ideas, but in second edition and later versions they should be mentioned in the corebook and the Umbra sourcebooks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-04T17:17:32-08:00","id":1555083,"title":"","content":"What are the books in first and second edition?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 11-04-2025, 08:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-05T08:37:55-08:00","id":1555121,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samuelalpha86</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1555034-i-have-a-question-about-epiphs?p=1555083#post1555083\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What are the books in first and second edition?</div> </div> </div> </div>As far as I know, Epiphs are mentioned briefly in the following books:<br /> <br /> Werewolf Revised Core Book, pg. 226<br /> <br /> Umbra (Revised), pg. 25<br /> <br /> Book of the Wyrm (2nd Edition), pg. 42<br /> <br /> W20 Core Book, Section &quot;Domains&quot;, pg. 314<br /> <br /> Probably Umbra 20 mentions them, too, but I don't have that book, so I can't confirm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28735-greywolf76","name":"Greywolf76","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28735_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}